     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS IS THE HISTORY FILE FOR POC NOTICES.      *
     A*                IT CONTAINS ONE RECORD FOR EACH POC NOTICE     *
     A*                STATE THAT NEEDS TO BE GENERATED FOR EACH      *
     A*                POLICY.                                        *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PPO01                     TEXT('POC NOTICE FILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*
     A            POCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            POFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            POEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            PODIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            POFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            POSTATE   R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('POC STATE')
     A            POUNID    R               REFFLD(A120)
     A                                      COLHDG('UNIQUE' 'IDENTIFIER')
     A            POTRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('TRANSACTION' 'DATE')
     A            POSBDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('SUBMISSION' 'DATE')
     A*
     A            PODOC         60A         COLHDG('POC NOTICE' 'TEMPLATE')
     A            POPATH       250A         COLHDG('POC NOTICE' 'PATH')
     A            POLANG        40A         COLHDG('POC NOTICE' 'LANGUAGE')
     A*
     A* MAINTENANCE FIELDS
     A*
     A            POUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            POPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            POTIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            PODT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
     A*
